  partName: Left Center Mounting Bolt
  description: The Left Center Mounting Bolt is a tiny, complex-shaped component
    situated at the top-left-center of the engine, fabricated from Material.001,
    playing a crucial role in securing the engine's center section to the vehicle's
    chassis. Its strategic location and high-strength material enable it to withstand
    significant forces and stresses, ensuring the engine's stability and reliability.
    Notably, the Left Center Mounting Bolt's complex shape allows for a precise fit,
    facilitating easy engine installation and maintenance.
